{
  "_comment": [
    "Source of truth for Alfheim's surface structures and the Cartographer's map shop.",
    "Design record: alfheim_reclaimed_design/THE_SURFACE.md. Generator: tools/gen_surface_works.py.",
    "Checker: tools/check_surface_works.py. Quests: tools/gen_cartographer.py.",
    "",
    "THIRTY-TWO structures, TEN archetypes, SIXTEEN biomes, exactly two per biome.",
    "",
    "`ground` is the internal y of a piece that must coincide with the terrain surface. It",
    "becomes the structure's start_height as `absolute: -ground`, because JigsawPlacement adds",
    "the heightmap value to the start position -- so a piece whose bowl floor is 14 blocks below",
    "its own surface plane needs its origin 14 blocks below the terrain.",
    "",
    "`shape` overrides the archetype's defaults. THE_SURFACE.md 6.3: two structures sharing an",
    "archetype must differ in at least two shape keys, and check_surface_works.py asserts it.",
    "",
    "Every block id below was checked against tools/registry_items.json, which was dumped from a",
    "running server. Do not add one that has not been."
  ],

